  "description": "LosAngeles 全服务一屏总览：探测健康、SLO 错误预算、firing 告警、容器与数据层状态。",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "asDropdown": true,
      "title": "LosAngeles 看板",
